    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_20061204.0579\n\nMOSCOW, Dec 4 , 2006, 2006\n\nURGENT  Ex-Russian PM released from hospital: report\n\n\n\n\nFormer Russian prime minister Yegor Gaidar, the victim of a suspicious poisoning last week, has been released from hospital in Moscow, the Interfax news agency reported late Monday quoting his spokesman.",
